 "languages_since_note": "A language is benchmarked only against codemap releases at or above its version here, so a rerun of an earlier release reproduces the report that release had (go, typescript, javascript and python have no entry and are always run).",
 "build_note": "groups.*.*[].build lists the Ubuntu 24.04 packages (apt) and the setup commands (run in the clone, after checkout, before truth) a repository needs; bench/run.sh runs them when BENCH_INSTALL_DEPS=1 (the CI workflow sets it) and skips apt otherwise. Go, TypeScript, JavaScript and Python repositories need none beyond their language toolchain."
